spice
* SPICE netlist for the given circuit

I1 2 1 DC 0     * Current source I = 0 between node 2 and 1
Vf 2 0 DC V_f   * Voltage source Vf between node 2 and ground
R1 3 0 R1       * Resistor R1 between node 3 and ground
R2 3 4 R2       * Resistor R2 between node 3 and 4
Vo 4 5 DC V_o   * Voltage source Vo between node 4 and 5
V1 5 0 DC 0     * Connect node 5 to ground

.end